OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Emma helps a village hall
OL,7,     Fmanager to look lump-free ready
OL,8,     Ffor her 40th birthday party. Dr
OL,9,     FNatalia digs out a cyst to give
OL,10,     Fher patient a smooth back for a
OL,11,     Fholiday to Egypt.
OL,12,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,13,     FAn explosion in a Californian
OL,14,     Fbeauty spa kills owner Ildiko
OL,15,     FKrajnyak and seriously injures
OL,16,     Fthree customers. Forensic experts
OL,17,     Funcover a sinister plot driven by
OL,18,     Fobsession and revenge.
